sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Customer
  participant UI as React app
  participant C as Clerk
  participant X as Convex

  U->>UI: Click Log in
  UI->>UI: SignInModal (stay on page)
  U->>C: Google / email / phone
  C-->>UI: Session + JWT
  UI->>X: users.syncProfile
  alt First visit
    UI->>UI: OnboardingModal
    U->>X: completeOnboarding
  end
  U->>UI: Add to cart to checkout
  UI->>X: orders.create (JWT)
  X-->>UI: orderNumber, points
